{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/(tools)/layout,_N_T_/(tools)/tools/layout,_N_T_/(tools)/tools/age-calculator/layout,_N_T_/(tools)/tools/age-calculator/page,_N_T_/tools/age-calculator"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"hi\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/a082d47af8c37992.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-fe1bb94b21fde89c.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-123aadff3a6f1f43.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/5030-dfb188e0fb5d9176.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-9edc01f96f8414ff.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/(tools)/tools/age-calculator/page-c693e4b7839570be.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/5878-ab61975c236bb910.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2972-f2e7899c8cf0f9e3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4a8f5ea9fb7efe7b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/(tools)/tools/page-578f067a7ab87dcf.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Age Calculator for Government Exams | CGSSB</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Calculate your exact age (years, months, days) as of a specific date for CG Police, CGPSC, and Vyapam exam notifications.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.jpg\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><header style=\"background-color:var(--bg-body);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;height:70px\"><a style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-primary);letter-spacing:-0.5px\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"CGSSB Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent;border-radius:6px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75\"/>CGSSB</a><nav class=\"desktop-only\" style=\"gap:24px\"><a style=\"font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/jobs\">Jobs</a><a style=\"font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/current-affairs\">Current Affairs</a><a style=\"font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/cg-gk\">CG GK</a><a style=\"font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/tools\">Tools</a></nav><button class=\"mobile-only\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\" style=\"background:none;border:none;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:5px;width:30px;height:30px;cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"display:block;width:25px;height:3px;background-color:var(--text-main);transition:all 0.3s;transform:none\"></span><span style=\"display:block;width:25px;height:3px;background-color:var(--text-main);opacity:1\"></span><span style=\"display:block;width:25px;height:3px;background-color:var(--text-main);transition:all 0.3s;transform:none\"></span></button></div></header><main style=\"min-height:calc(100vh - 70px - 150px)\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"padding-top:60px;padding-bottom:60px\"><section style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px\"><h1 style=\"font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:15px\">Exam Age Calculator</h1><p style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--text-muted);max-width:700px;margin:0 auto\">Most government jobs require you to calculate your exact age on a specific cutoff date (e.g., January 1). Use this tool to find your precise age in years, months, and days.</p></section><section><div class=\"card\" style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto\"><form style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><label for=\"dob\" style=\"font-weight:600\">Date of Birth (जन्म तिथि)</label><input type=\"date\" id=\"dob\" required=\"\" style=\"padding:12px;font-size:1rem;border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:var(--border-radius)\" value=\"\"/></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><label for=\"targetDate\" style=\"font-weight:600\">Calculate Age As Of (किस तारीख तक)</label><input type=\"date\" id=\"targetDate\" required=\"\" style=\"padding:12px;font-size:1rem;border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:var(--border-radius)\" value=\"\"/><small style=\"color:var(--text-muted)\">* As per government job notification (e.g., 01/01/2026)</small></div><button type=\"submit\" style=\"padding:14px;background-color:var(--color-primary);color:white;border:none;border-radius:var(--border-radius);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;margin-top:10px\">Calculate Age</button></form></div></section><section style=\"margin-top:60px;max-width:800px;margin:60px auto 0\"><h2>How to use this Age Calculator?</h2><ol style=\"padding-left:20px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:30px;line-height:1.8\"><li>Select your Date of Birth (DOB) from your 10th marksheet.</li><li>Enter the Target Date exactly as mentioned in the official job notification.</li><li>Click Calculate to get your exact age. Compare this with the minimum and maximum age limits of the vacancy.</li></ol><h2>Why is accurate age calculation important for CGSSB &amp; CGPSC?</h2><p style=\"color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.8\">In Chhattisgarh government exams like CG Police, Patwari, or State Services, age relaxation rules apply for SC, ST, OBC, and female candidates. However, the base calculation must be flawless. Even a difference of one day can determine your eligibility for an exam. This tool ensures 100% accuracy based on the standard calendar calculations used by government boards.</p></section></div></main><footer style=\"background-color:var(--bg-card);border-top:1px solid var(--border-color);padding:40px 0 20px;margin-top:60px\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center\"><h3 style=\"margin-bottom:10px\">Chhattisgarh Career &amp; Education Portal</h3><p style=\"max-width:600px;font-size:0.9rem\">One-stop destination for CGSSB, CGPSC, Vyapam notifications, syllabus, results, and study materials.</p><div style=\"max-width:800px;background-color:#fffbe8;border:1px solid #fde68a;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:6px;margin-top:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#92400e;text-align:left\"><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> CGSSB is an independent informational website and is not affiliated with or operated by the Government of Chhattisgarh, CGSSB, CG Vyapam, CGPSC, or any other government department or examination authority. For official information, please verify details from the relevant official website or notification.</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:15px;margin-top:25px;padding-bottom:25px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color);width:100%;max-width:800px\"><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/about-us\">About Us</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/author/yuvraj-pratap-rajwade\">Author</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/editorial-policy\">Editorial Policy</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/correction-policy\">Correction Policy</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/contact-us\">Contact Us</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/terms\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/disclaimer\">Disclaimer</a></div><div style=\"margin-top:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-muted)\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> CGSSB Portal. Built for the students of Chhattisgarh. <br/>Email us at: <a href=\"mailto:contact@cgssb.com.in\" style=\"color:var(--color-primary)\">contact@cgssb.com.in</a></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-fe1bb94b21fde89c.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/a082d47af8c37992.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"2:I[2846,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[1858,[\\\"2310\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/(tools)/tools/age-calculator/page-c693e4b7839570be.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[4707,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[6423,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n7:I[5702,[\\\"5878\\\",\\\"static/chunks/5878-ab61975c236bb910.js\\\",\\\"2972\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2972-f2e7899c8cf0f9e3.js\\\",\\\"3185\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4a8f5ea9fb7efe7b.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\nc:I[2972,[\\\"2972\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2972-f2e7899c8cf0f9e3.js\\\",\\\"1078\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/(tools)/tools/page-578f067a7ab87dcf.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\ne:I[1060,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n8:{\\\"fontFamily\\\":\\\"system-ui,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,\\\\\\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"100vh\\\",\\\"textAlign\\\":\\\"center\\\",\\\"display\\\":\\\"flex\\\",\\\"flexDirection\\\":\\\"column\\\",\\\"alignItems\\\":\\\"center\\\",\\\"justifyContent\\\":\\\"center\\\"}\\n9:{\\\"display\\\":\\\"inline-block\\\",\\\"margin\\\":\\\"0 20px 0 0\\\",\\\"padding\\\":\\\"0 23px 0 0\\\",\